 bmissions for the 2027 program are open.\n\nDeadlines\nSymposium\, works
 hop and forum proposal submission: 2026-10-29 (estimated)\nOral and post
 er abstract submission: 2026-12-10 (estimated)\nTravel award application
 : 2026-12-15 (estimated)\nLate-breaking research submission: 2027-03-18 
 (estimated)\n\nhttps://cpdd.org/meetings/current-meeting/
LOCATION:Toronto\, Ontario\, CA\, Sheraton Centre Toronto Hotel
URL:https://cpdd.org/meetings/current-meeting/
